ked, upset, or angry expression — her mouth is open, eyebrows raised, and she appears to be reacting emotionally to what Brian is saying.\n- In frames 17–18, she is gesturing with her hand and appears to be speaking defensively or confrontationally.\n- There is **no visual evidence** in any of the 30 frames that she laughs after Brian’s dumping statement. Her facial expressions are consistently of distress, anger, or disbelief — not amusement.\n\n---\n\n**5. Emotional interactions suggesting relationship drama?**\n\n✅ **YES.**  \nThe entire segment is framed as “Real Girlfriend Vs. Online Girlfriend,” and the emotional tension is evident:\n- The green dress woman (presumably the “real girlfriend”) is visibly upset.\n- Brian is calmly explaining his decision to leave her.\n- The woman in the pink top (Dominique, the “online girlfriend”) is present and observing, adding to the interpersonal conflict.\n\n---\n\n**6. Temporal sequence: dumping event followed by green dress woman\'s reaction?**\n\n✅ **YES — the sequence is clear.**\n\n- Brian’s dumping statement begins around frame 24 and continues through 29.\n- The green dress woman’s emotional reaction is visible in frames 21–22 (which may be slightly before the full dumping statement, but within the same confrontation) and continues in subsequent frames.\n- Even if her reaction precedes the full verbal confirmation of dumping, it is clearly in response to the context of Brian’s actions and statements — and again, **her reaction is not laughter**.\n\n---\n\n### ✅ FINAL VERDICT:\n\n**Answer \'1\' ("She laughs") is INCORRECT.**\n\nThe visual evidence conclusively shows that the woman in the green dress does **not** laugh after Brian dumps his girlfriend. Instead, she displays clear signs of emotional distress, shock, or anger. There is no frame in which she is laughing or smiling in reaction to the breakup.\n\n---\n\n**Correct Answer (based on visual evidence):** She reacts with shock, anger, or distress — **not laughter.**'}, {'batch_start': 120, 'batch_end': 150, 'image_paths': ['/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/JTa_Ue2MSwc/frames/frame_1035.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/JTa_Ue2MSwc/frames/frame_1036.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/JTa_Ue2MSwc/frames/frame_1037.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/JTa_Ue2MSwc/frames/frame_1038.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/JTa_Ue2MSwc/frames/frame_1039.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/JTa_Ue2MSwc/frames/frame_1040.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/JTa_Ue2MSwc/frames/frame_1041.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/JTa_Ue2MSwc/frames/frame_1042.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/JTa_Ue2MSwc/frames/frame_1043.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/JTa_Ue2MSwc/frames/frame_1044.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/JTa_Ue2MSwc/frames/frame_1045.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/JTa_Ue2MSwc/frames/frame_1046.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/JTa_Ue2MSwc/frames/frame_1047.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/JTa_Ue2MSwc/frames/frame_1048.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/JTa_Ue2MSwc/frames/frame_1049.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/JTa_Ue2MSwc/frames/frame_1050.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/JTa_Ue2MSwc/frames/frame_1051.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/JTa_Ue2MSwc/frames/frame_1052.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/JTa_Ue2MSwc/frames/frame_1053.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/JTa_Ue2MSwc/frames/frame_1054.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/JTa_Ue2MSwc/frames/frame_1055.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/JTa_Ue2MSwc/frames/frame_1056.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/JTa_Ue2MSwc/frames/frame_1057.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/JTa_Ue2MSwc/frames/frame_1058.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/JTa_Ue2MSwc/frames/frame_1059.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_process